<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59662" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κράσπεδ-ον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>edge, border, skirt</i>, esp. of
			cloth, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				2.53
			</span></i>; of the <i>fringe</i> or <i>tassel</i> worn by Jews,
				<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				9.20
			</span></i>: mostly in pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκροισι λαίφους
				κρασπέδοις</span> (v. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.2b
				</span></i>
			) <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				524
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κράσπεδα στεμμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					475
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Diph.
				43.30
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσᾶ κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Chamael.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				9.374a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				3.36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				37
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
			mostly in pl., <i>skirts</i> or <i>edge</i> of a country, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				602
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				381
			</span></i>; of a mountain, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				4.6.8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς κρασπέδοισι
			στρατοπέδου</span> on <i>the skirts</i> of the army, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				661
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς πελταστὰς ἐπὶ τὰ κ. ἑκατέρωθεν
					καθίστασθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					3.2.16
				</span></i>
			: also in sg., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τιμολέοντα ὥσπερ ἐκ κ. τινὸς λεπτοῦ
					τῆς πολίχνης τῇ Σικελίᾳ προσηρτημένον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Tim.</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. αἰγιαλοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.78
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Dionys.
			</span></i> Cyzic.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			Medic., <i>affection of the uvula, fimbria</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SA</u>
				1.8
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
